  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Energy Fund Africa (SEFA) Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase II of support to SEFA. SEFA is a multi-donor trust fund (special fund) administered by the African Development Bank. SEFA supports medium-scale and small renewable energy and energy-efficiency projects developed by the private sector. SEFA offers technical assistance at different stages in the project development cycle as well as concessional financing.</narrative>
  </description>
